?"],["Leo","A new road. But we worked out a plan.","Uma estrada nova. Mas resolvemos um plano."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Contrast past and present.","pt":"Compare.","model":"We would meet; now we don’t."},{"q":"Use work out.","pt":"Use.","model":"We worked it out."},{"q":"Invite neighbors.","pt":"Convide.","model":"Join us on Sunday!"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 5-line community notice using would, used to and Past Simple.","model":"Neighbors would meet every Sunday. They used to share meals. Last year a new road changed the street. We have worked out a plan. Join us on June 12 and bring a dish!","checklist":["Usei **would**","Usei **used to**","Usei **Past Simple**"],"words":"5 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “community notice” mean?","opts":["aviso comunitário","reencontro de vizinhos","música de rua"],"ans":0,"why":"**community notice** = aviso comunitário."},{"q":"What does “neighbor reunion” mean?","opts":["refeição de domingo","reencontro de vizinhos","estrada nova"],"ans":1,"why":"**neighbor reunion** = reencontro de vizinhos."},{"q":"What does “Sunday meal” mean?","opts":["música de rua","traga um prato","refeição de domingo"],"ans":2,"why":"**Sunday meal** = refeição de domingo."},{"q":"What does “street music” mean?","opts":["música de rua","estrada nova","almoço colaborativo"],"ans":0,"why":"**street music** = música de rua."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Trein